# =============================================================================
# Bug Bounty Workspace — .gitignore
# Policy: WORKFLOW/config/skills/scripts tracked. BOUNTY FINDINGS NEVER PUSHED.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Secrets / credentials — kabhi commit nahi ----
.env
*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*oauth*
*credential*
.sops.yaml
**/scope.yaml
**.scope.yaml

# ---- Bounty FINDINGS / evidence / reports — NEVER push ----
evidence/
reports/
h1_*.md
h1_*.json
kiwi-*
*-report.md
*-report.json
priceline_progress_report/
**/NOTES.md
**/NEXT_STEPS.md
**/*_root_report.md
**/*root_report*
**/AUTONOMOUS_HUNT_PROMPT.md

# ---- Recon/target data (program-specific, includes recon.db + candidates) ----
recon/data/
**/candidate_report.md
**/top_priority.json
**/run_meta.json
**/recon.db

# ---- Binaries / heavy artifacts ----
*.img
*.apk
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.jar
*.exe
*.bin
*.qcow2
*.so
magisk_extract/
emulator/

# ---- Dependencies / runtime ----
node_modules/
.opencode/node_modules/
.playwright-mcp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- OS/junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp